      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身披众多赛马娘的憧憬，\n西沙里奥就此成为了一位\n“伟大的后冠赛马娘”――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b93a1dcf49a2bfab33316652e990339fc9a71491ee266f23b8b462e7c547bcf",
